ustomizable interior design. Computer systems with different specs.<br><br> \u26aa Feel like a boss when you are a corporate group, and manage your Corporation like a real game corp.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333800/extras/44ea5017dbbe8e7c407c13c06f0f319a.poster.avif?t=1726313384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333800/extras/44ea5017dbbe8e7c407c13c06f0f319a.webm?t=1726313384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333800/extras/44ea5017dbbe8e7c407c13c06f0f319a.mp4?t=1726313384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
